WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Open a permitted chat, post or article editor and choose OpStack intelligence.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Choose Draft new content, Improve existing text or Summarise source text.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 3: Check the visible source field and instructions before generating.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Step 4: Review the result and choose Use in editor, adding below or explicitly replacing text.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Step 5: Use the editor’s ordinary Send, Publish or Save action when ready.
